<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Kwoon Chung shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Kwoon Chung shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Kwoon Chung Bus Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Kwoon Chung shares closed Tuesday up HK$0.125 at HK$3.50.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong-based bus service operator ordered 30 high-quality tour coaches earlier this year, expanding its fleet beyond 1,000 buses.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2483 6369</p>
